    "permission": "Seymour Duncan encourages sharing wiring diagrams freely; commercial use needs prior written permission. LIMITATIONS: Generic humbuckers use logical coil terminals, not lead colors/polarity. Bridge ground, cable, and load omitted; no bridge terminal. Blade poles model selection logic, not physical terminals. Logical pot lugs and linear scale, not audio taper. Two volumes exceed the one-master-volume limit, so the estimate is unavailable. Each push/pull switches its own pickup series/parallel."
